WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
-== [ www.OpenSubtitles.org ] ==-

2
00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:17.708
[♪ legendary music playing]

3
00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:19.292
[lightsaber activates]

4
00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.000
[♪ music fades]

5
00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:27.500
[whooshes]

6
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.917
[silence]

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.125
-[laser booming]
-[gasps]

8
00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:38.167
[rumbling]

9
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.375
-[people screaming]
-[gasps]

10
00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:44.667
-[rumbling]
-[all gasping]

11
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.875
[miner] What is that?

12
00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:51.917
[♪ sinister music playing]

13
00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:00.833
[♪ music ends]

14
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.250
-[citizens murmuring]
-[gasps]

15
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.708
[citizens exclaiming]

16
00:01:17.792 --> 00:01:19.208
[all screaming]

17
00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.917
{\an8}[♪ tense music playing]

18
00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:36.458
<i>Bibin must be evacuated immediately.</i>

19
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.500
<i>Our people</i>
<i>will need all the help they can get</i>

20
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.958
<i>-in order to fly off this planet safely.</i>
-[Kwana] Hurry!

21
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.958
[electronic beeping]

22
00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:45.625
[Gennoh] The beam missed?

23
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:48.083
[Nawaam] Fire the second shot.

24
00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.167
Sir.

25
00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:54.875
[digital beeping]

26
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:01.375
[weapon whirring]

27
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:06.042
[weapon powering up]

28
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:10.708
[gasps]

29
00:02:10.792 --> 00:02:13.667
-[electricity crackling]
-[scientist screams]

30
00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.125
-[Zhima gasps]
-[Nawaam gasps]

31
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.583
[scientists whimpering]

32
00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:20.542
[exclaims]

33
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:22.458
-[electricity buzzing]
-[Nawaam grunts]

34
00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:28.708
[scientists screaming]

35
00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:33.750
[panting. gasps]

36
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.250
-[screams]
-[metal creaks]

37
00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:37.333
[gasps]

38
00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:40.292
[straining]

39
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:42.375
[♪ tense music playing]

40
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:48.208
[bubbling]

41
00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:53.667
[whooshes]

42
00:03:00.542 --> 00:03:02.333
[Kwana] Remain calm. everyone.

43
00:03:02.417 --> 00:03:04.083
Everything will be all right.

44
00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:05.417
-[man] Kwana.
-[Kwana] Hmm?

45
00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.875
There aren't enough ships
to evacuate everyone.

46
00:03:08.958 --> 00:03:10.875
-Hmm.
-[indistinct chatter]

47
00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:13.833
Unload all the ore from the cargo holds.

48
00:03:13.917 --> 00:03:16.542
Everyone. you'll have
to leave your belongings.

49
00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:20.375
We must work together so we can get
as many people as possible on board.

50
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.833
-[citizens murmuring]
-[device beeps]

51
00:03:24.917 --> 00:03:27.000
I'm calling all Asteroid Diggers
to assist us.

52
00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.458
[over comms] <i>We don't have enough ships</i>
<i>to evacuate Bibin.</i>

53
00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:34.875
<i>Please. we need one of your ships</i>
<i>to transport refugees.</i>

54
00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:36.417
-[grunts]
-Hmm.

55
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.292
-[Kara panting]
-[beeping]

56
00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:40.375
Ethan?

57
00:03:40.458 --> 00:03:42.333
<i>I'm so glad you're alive. Juro.</i>

58
00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:43.625
Thanks.

59
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:47.125
The power of that beam
is beyond what I could have imagined.

60
00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:50.792
What kind of weapon are we dealing with.
and where is he hiding?

61
00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:53.333
<i>The enemy's stronghold is on Yaago.</i>

62
00:03:53.417 --> 00:03:55.625
<i>Nawaam's engineers</i>
<i>built a powerful cannon.</i>

63
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:59.000
<i>and its energy source</i>
<i>appears to be kyber crystals.</i>

64
00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:01.875
<i>But I don't know how it reached Bibin.</i>

65
00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:04.000
<i>I'll keep investigating</i>
<i>and get back to you.</i>

66
00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:06.500
Right. But make sure you're on your guard.

67
00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:09.458
-[warbles]
-Hmm.

68
00:04:09.542 --> 00:04:11.250
[distant explosions]

69
00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:16.208
[panting]

70
00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:25.417
-[panting]
-[rumbling]

71
00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:29.000
-[crashing]
-[grunts. panting]

72
00:04:31.292 --> 00:04:33.417
[powering up]

73
00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.667
[doors hissing]

74
00:04:36.458 --> 00:04:37.958
[metallic creaking]

75
00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:41.792
[panting] It's been a while.

76
00:04:51.417 --> 00:04:53.292
[droid beeping]

77
00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.542
[Tafflah] An old reliable ship has been
found at the palace maintenance deck.

78
00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:02.083
-[rumbling]
-Standby at the port.

79
00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:04.792
-[gasps]
-[crashing]

80
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:07.375
[exclaims]

81
00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:12.542
[thuds. explodes]

82
00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:16.750
[engines powering up]

83
00:05:21.792 --> 00:05:23.667
[indistinct chatter]

84
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.708
-[child whimpers]
-[citizen breathing heavily]

85
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:32.583
[engines whirring]

86
00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:33.667
[sighs]

87
00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.542
-[Juro and Kwana] Hmm?
-[Kara gasps]

88
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:43.958
[indistinct chatter]

89
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.542
[citizen] We're one of the search parties.

90
00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:50.542
This is a log of who is accounted for.

91
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:52.000
[electronic beeping]

92
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:57.792
It seems that everyone else
is back at the port.

93
00:05:57.875 --> 00:05:59.458
We can start evacuating now.

94
00:06:00.333 --> 00:06:01.708
Where's Lady Tafflah?

95
00:06:01.792 --> 00:06:04.625
[citizen] She said she was going
to the palace to secure a ship.

96
00:06:04.708 --> 00:06:07.000
-[Kwana] I would like to speak to her.
-[citizen] Yes.

97
00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:09.167
-[device beeps]
-Lady Tafflah.

98
00:06:10.542 --> 00:06:11.625
Lady Tafflah?

99
00:06:11.708 --> 00:06:14.125
-Do you read me. Lady Tafflah?
-[gasps]

100
00:06:14.208 --> 00:06:15.583
[citizen] Lady Tafflah!

101
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:21.250
[engines revving]

102
00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:24.250
[Kara panting]

103
00:06:24.333 --> 00:06:27.875
This is the royal hangar.
There's a maintenance deck underground.

104
00:06:30.292 --> 00:06:32.083
-[rumbling]
-[Juro grunts]

105
00:06:32.167 --> 00:06:34.208
[Kara grunts. exclaims]

106
00:06:34.292 --> 00:06:36.208
[lightsaber crackling]

107
00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.250
[Tafflah panting]

108
00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.250
[cracking]

109
00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:45.917
-[lightsaber deactivates]
-[Kwana] Hmm.

110
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.917
[straining]

111
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.500
-[Kwana grunts]
-[door thuds]

112
00:06:49.583 --> 00:06:50.875
[Kara panting]

113
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:52.875
[gasps]

114
00:06:52.958 --> 00:06:54.875
-[clangs]
-[Kara grunts]

115
00:06:56.125 --> 00:06:57.625
-[Tafflah yelps]
-[Kara grunts]

116
00:07:01.417 --> 00:07:04.000
[Kara grunts. straining]

117
00:07:05.417 --> 00:07:06.625
[grunts]

118
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:08.000
[straining]

119
00:07:13.167 --> 00:07:14.167
[groans]

120
00:07:15.792 --> 00:07:17.250
[both scream]

121
00:07:17.708 --> 00:07:18.708
Kara!

122
00:07:18.792 --> 00:07:21.417
-[rock thuds]
-[doors whirring]

123
00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.833
[both straining]

124
00:07:24.667 --> 00:07:25.667
[grunts]

125
00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.333
[both grunting]

126
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.875
-[Tafflah panting]
-[Kara gasps]

127
00:07:33.292 --> 00:07:34.792
[doors slam]

128
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:38.208
-[♪ tense music playing]
-[indistinct chatter]

129
00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:41.417
[whimpering]

130
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:46.667
[citizen sobbing]

131
00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.958
-[sighs. gasps]
-[engine whirring]

132
00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:52.167
[chuckles]

133
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.000
[citizens gasping]

134
00:07:55.667 --> 00:07:57.292
[both laugh]

135
00:07:58.583 --> 00:07:59.583
Heh.

136
00:08:00.417 --> 00:08:03.542
-[Kara] My Lady. are you all right?
-Hmm.

137
00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:06.750
[Tafflah grunts]

138
00:08:07.958 --> 00:08:09.583
-[droid whirring]
-[Kara] Huh?

139
00:08:15.083 --> 00:08:16.750
[droid chirps]

140
00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:17.958
[exhales]

141
00:08:18.667 --> 00:08:23.625
[Kara] Juro. we're all right. but it looks
like the door is completely sealed.

142
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:25.083
-Understood.
-[Kwana grunts]

143
00:08:25.167 --> 00:08:27.292
We'll find another way to get you two out.

144
00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:28.583
Please stand by.

145
00:08:28.667 --> 00:08:31.542
[grunts] Huh?

146
00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:34.000
[Tafflah] It's broken.

147
00:08:34.083 --> 00:08:35.875
And unfortunately. without it.

148
00:08:35.958 --> 00:08:39.250
we don't have any other way
to open the hatch up there.

149
00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:40.875
[Kara] Can it be done remotely?

150
00:08:40.958 --> 00:08:43.833
If we sent a signal to one of the ships.
could they do it?

151
00:08:43.917 --> 00:08:46.167
-[lightsaber buzzing]
-[gasps]

152
00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:48.375
[Tafflah] Are you a Jedi?

153
00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:53.625
Uh. I guess. Yeah.
I mean. I'm Juro's Padawan. So...

154
00:08:54.917 --> 00:08:56.583
What is your name?

155
00:08:56.667 --> 00:08:57.792
Kara.

156
00:08:57.875 --> 00:09:00.250
-Kara. daughter of Lah Zhima.
-[gasps]

157
00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:06.167
You know. Kwana said my father
was a master killer.

158
00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:09.000
Can I ask. what exactly did my father do?

159
00:09:13.042 --> 00:09:14.917
[silence]

160
00:09:17.542 --> 00:09:20.292
[Tafflah] I didn't know
that he was still alive.

161
00:09:23.167 --> 00:09:26.542
[Kwana] There should be a circuit
that controls that specific hatch.

162
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.583
Then that means we just need to figure out

163
00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:31.583
how to divert power
and connect it back to that circuit.

164
00:09:31.667 --> 00:09:33.875
[rumbling]

165
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:36.917
[Tafflah] I see.

166
00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.333
Zhima ended up becoming a sabersmith.

167
00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.583
Yes.

168
00:09:41.667 --> 00:09:44.667
I have no idea what my father
was like as a Jedi.

169
00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.708
He never shared stories from that time.

170
00:09:47.625 --> 00:09:48.625
Of course you don't.

171
00:09:49.542 --> 00:09:51.417
You know. in the end. the truth is.

172
00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.667
I don't think any of us
really knew him at all.

173
00:09:54.875 --> 00:09:57.917
[Kara] Um. did my father
actually kill his master?

174
00:09:59.792 --> 00:10:01.708
Why would he do such a thing?

175
00:10:02.375 --> 00:10:04.083
All I know for sure

176
00:10:04.167 --> 00:10:06.875
is that Zhima did indeed
do what is claimed.

177
00:10:06.958 --> 00:10:10.750
But why he did it is a question
that no one knows the answer to.

178
00:10:10.833 --> 00:10:12.667
[sighs]

179
00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:17.458
The Jedi had vanished quite some time ago.

180
00:10:17.542 --> 00:10:20.875
There were few left who would even
be able to tell stories of them.

181
00:10:21.667 --> 00:10:24.292
Reno Tsutara was among those few.

182
00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:26.625
He arrived at Bibin alongside Juro.

183
00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.708
<i>Reno was one of the last 50</i>
<i>surviving Jedi Masters left.</i>

184
00:10:32.625 --> 00:10:35.667
<i>He came to Bibin</i>
<i>with the goal of restoring the Order.</i>

185
00:10:36.625 --> 00:10:40.792
<i>My people and I agreed with his vision</i>
<i>and decided to support it.</i>

186
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:46.500
<i>I thought the Order was fighting</i>
<i>for peace. free of other interests.</i>

187
00:10:46.583 --> 00:10:48.792
<i>And that their success</i>
<i>would be beneficial.</i>

188
00:10:48.875 --> 00:10:51.708
[♪ gentle music playing]

189
00:10:55.167 --> 00:10:56.833
<i>Zhima was among the younglings</i>

190
00:10:56.917 --> 00:11:00.917
<i>who had been gathered and brought here</i>
<i>from all corners of the galaxy.</i>

191
00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.000
<i>And it did not take very long</i>
<i>before he became a standout.</i>

192
00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:07.500
So then my father was strong.

193
00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:08.792
Yes.

194
00:11:09.625 --> 00:11:13.708
Before long. Zhima and Juro
completed their training and became Jedi.

195
00:11:16.042 --> 00:11:18.917
<i>Reno sought to expand the Jedi Order.</i>

196
00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.250
<i>And both Juro and Zhima</i>

197
00:11:20.333 --> 00:11:22.625
<i>each took on Padawans at his behest.</i>

198
00:11:23.375 --> 00:11:26.958
<i>Although Zhima wasn't exactly</i>
<i>a natural as a teacher.</i>

199
00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.458
<i>he quickly began to enjoy it.</i>

200
00:11:31.292 --> 00:11:32.875
<i>Around that time.</i>

201
00:11:32.958 --> 00:11:35.208
<i>Reno began actively conducting</i>
<i>diplomatic missions</i>

202
00:11:35.292 --> 00:11:36.833
<i>with other star systems.</i>

203
00:11:36.917 --> 00:11:40.000
He made great progress with trade as well.

204
00:11:40.083 --> 00:11:43.250
This very ship
was the one he used for those missions.

205
00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.125
At that time.
there was no central government.

206
00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:52.250
<i>As such. trade was not prosperous.</i>

207
00:11:52.333 --> 00:11:57.417
<i>But leave it to Reno to somehow convince</i>
<i>other worlds to make him trade ambassador.</i>

208
00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.542
<i>so he could help everyone</i>
<i>prosper and grow.</i>

209
00:12:00.625 --> 00:12:01.625
[inaudible conversation]

210
00:12:01.708 --> 00:12:05.042
[Tafflah] <i>When the head of a spaceport</i>
<i>from a wealthy family went missing.</i>

211
00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:08.083
<i>he even stepped in to quell</i>
<i>the resulting internal struggle.</i>

212
00:12:09.792 --> 00:12:13.000
Thanks to that. Bibin's commerce expanded.

213
00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:14.583
But behind the scenes.

214
00:12:14.667 --> 00:12:17.625
Zhima was also becoming
quite a powerful figure.

215
00:12:17.708 --> 00:12:19.083
My father?

216
00:12:20.667 --> 00:12:23.875
[Tafflah] Reno would send him out
to fight any surviving Sith.

217
00:12:25.292 --> 00:12:27.958
<i>At the time. there were star systems</i>
<i>that employed Sith</i>

218
00:12:28.042 --> 00:12:29.875
<i>to gain trade advantage.</i>

219
00:12:30.833 --> 00:12:34.958
<i>Zhima was more than happy to fine-tune</i>
<i>his fighting skills with actual combat.</i>

220
00:12:35.792 --> 00:12:39.583
<i>He truly believed that all these threats</i>
<i>should be eliminated</i>

221
00:12:39.667 --> 00:12:42.500
<i>and that the galaxy would be</i>
<i>better off without the Sith.</i>

222
00:12:48.208 --> 00:12:52.625
However. the more Reno
became absorbed in politics.

223
00:12:52.708 --> 00:12:55.833
<i>the more Zhima appeared</i>
<i>to become absorbed in battle.</i>

224
00:13:00.958 --> 00:13:02.250
[gasps]

225
00:13:05.042 --> 00:13:06.042
[whooshes]

226
00:13:09.625 --> 00:13:10.625
Keep moving.

227
00:13:10.708 --> 00:13:13.500
It's this way to the speeders.
Fit as many as you can.

228
00:13:13.583 --> 00:13:15.958
-[citizens sobbing]
-Don't worry. my crew is coming back

229
00:13:16.042 --> 00:13:18.417
with a larger ship to take everyone else.

230
00:13:19.875 --> 00:13:22.583
Juro had decided to go to Hy Izlan.

231
00:13:22.667 --> 00:13:26.375
which meant that Zhima was essentially
Reno's only remaining apprentice.

232
00:13:27.417 --> 00:13:30.333
I accepted the fact
that the government and the Order

233
00:13:30.417 --> 00:13:32.625
<i>-mutually completed each other.</i>
-[inaudible]

234
00:13:32.708 --> 00:13:36.042
<i>And that the power to preserve both</i>
<i>was being cultivated.</i>

235
00:13:38.583 --> 00:13:40.417
<i>But Zhima rebelled.</i>

236
00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.125
<i>saying that the Jedi</i>
<i>did not belong in politics.</i>

237
00:13:43.208 --> 00:13:45.583
<i>So he clashed with Reno.</i>

238
00:13:46.708 --> 00:13:51.542
And then came the day.
the day of the incident.

239
00:13:51.625 --> 00:13:52.625
[sighs]

240
00:13:53.583 --> 00:13:54.833
[lightsabers crackling]

241
00:13:57.125 --> 00:13:58.125
Please stop this!

242
00:13:58.208 --> 00:13:59.750
[glass shatters]

243
00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.792
-[lightsabers crackling]
-[Reno grunts]

244
00:14:03.875 --> 00:14:05.833
[♪ dramatic music playing]

245
00:14:08.333 --> 00:14:09.625
[lasers firing]

246
00:14:15.292 --> 00:14:17.042
[lightsaber buzzing]

247
00:14:32.625 --> 00:14:34.250
-[rumbling]
-[lightsaber buzzing]

248
00:14:37.333 --> 00:14:39.333
[♪ dramatic music continues]

249
00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.000
[lightsaber crackling]

250
00:15:01.417 --> 00:15:03.125
[both grunting]

251
00:15:04.667 --> 00:15:07.833
-[Reno growls]
-[lightsaber warbles]

252
00:15:09.125 --> 00:15:10.417
[Zhima gasps]

253
00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:12.667
Wait. what? What is your lightsaber doing?

254
00:15:13.333 --> 00:15:15.417
-I don't know.
-[warbling continues]

255
00:15:16.083 --> 00:15:18.083
[Zhima grunts]

256
00:15:19.417 --> 00:15:21.417
[♪ dramatic music continues]

257
00:15:27.917 --> 00:15:29.625
[lightsaber buzzing]

258
00:15:32.042 --> 00:15:35.125
[breathing heavily]

259
00:15:37.917 --> 00:15:39.917
[warbling]

260
00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:45.125
[high-pitched ringing]

261
00:15:47.167 --> 00:15:50.292
[lightsaber buzzing]

262
00:15:50.792 --> 00:15:52.583
[gasps]

263
00:15:56.208 --> 00:15:58.375
[♪ dramatic music continues]

264
00:16:00.083 --> 00:16:01.625
What color is that?

265
00:16:03.292 --> 00:16:05.875
[warbling]

266
00:16:15.958 --> 00:16:18.000
[♪ sinister music playing]

267
00:16:18.083 --> 00:16:19.500
[gasps]

268
00:16:20.542 --> 00:16:21.542
[body thuds]

269
00:16:23.375 --> 00:16:24.750
[lightsaber deactivates]

270
00:16:24.833 --> 00:16:25.833
[lasers firing]

271
00:16:29.667 --> 00:16:33.750
[Tafflah] <i>After that.</i>
<i>no one saw Zhima again.</i>

272
00:16:34.542 --> 00:16:35.833
That's everything.

273
00:16:35.917 --> 00:16:38.042
I've now told you all that I know.

274
00:16:38.125 --> 00:16:40.583
I ended up with no choice.

275
00:16:40.667 --> 00:16:45.250
After the events of that day.
the Jedi Order had to be disbanded.

276
00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.458
But why? Why would he do that?

277
00:16:51.708 --> 00:16:52.708
I don't know.

278
00:16:52.792 --> 00:16:55.708
I can only guess that perhaps
Zhima wished to prove himself

279
00:16:55.792 --> 00:16:57.667
that he had surpassed his master.

280
00:16:58.375 --> 00:16:59.458
It's hard to imagine.

281
00:16:59.542 --> 00:17:02.708
I just can't picture my father
challenging his own master.

282
00:17:02.792 --> 00:17:04.792
Not to mention. then killing him.

283
00:17:06.542 --> 00:17:09.167
[Tafflah] That must be because
he was a good father to you.

284
00:17:10.042 --> 00:17:12.417
However. when Zhima wielded
his lightsaber that day...

285
00:17:13.667 --> 00:17:14.750
his eyes...

286
00:17:17.292 --> 00:17:19.667
[whooshes]

287
00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:26.583
Juro. the port won't hold out
for much longer.

288
00:17:28.125 --> 00:17:29.583
We're almost there.

289
00:17:30.333 --> 00:17:31.958
-[tools clinking]
-Hmm?

290
00:17:35.167 --> 00:17:36.875
[doors hissing]

291
00:17:41.792 --> 00:17:42.792
-[rumbling]
-[both gasp]

292
00:17:45.167 --> 00:17:46.625
[both chuckle]

293
00:17:48.875 --> 00:17:49.875
[both gasp]

294
00:17:49.958 --> 00:17:51.250
-Isn't this...
-[thuds]

295
00:17:52.292 --> 00:17:54.042
...Master Reno's ship?

296
00:17:54.792 --> 00:17:57.958
Yes. I couldn't access it
from the docking bay before.

297
00:17:58.042 --> 00:18:00.500
But it would seem like
that's no longer an issue.

298
00:18:02.667 --> 00:18:03.667
[sighs]

299
00:18:06.625 --> 00:18:07.625
[sighs]

300
00:18:11.083 --> 00:18:13.250
[digital beeping]

301
00:18:15.292 --> 00:18:16.667
So far. so good.

302
00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.708
Would you mind if I took a look around?

303
00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:23.083
There might be things we can move
to make room for more people.

304
00:18:26.625 --> 00:18:27.625
[panting]

305
00:18:32.958 --> 00:18:34.792
[exhales] Huh?

306
00:18:38.458 --> 00:18:40.375
-[clicks]
-[door whirring]

307
00:18:40.458 --> 00:18:41.458
[gasps]

308
00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.625
Oh? [exhales]

309
00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.250
[grunts softly]

310
00:18:55.333 --> 00:18:57.000
[lights clicking]

311
00:19:05.708 --> 00:19:07.083
-[air hisses]
-[thuds]

312
00:19:07.167 --> 00:19:09.417
[screams. grunts]

313
00:19:10.125 --> 00:19:12.000
[gasps] Who is that?

314
00:19:12.083 --> 00:19:13.958
[whirring]

315
00:19:14.042 --> 00:19:16.375
[♪ sinister music playing]

316
00:19:17.667 --> 00:19:19.542
[Kara breathing heavily]

317
00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:20.792
[switches clicking]

318
00:19:20.875 --> 00:19:23.625
Not good. Too much time has passed.

319
00:19:23.708 --> 00:19:26.000
[Kwana] Hey. Kara. you down here?

320
00:19:26.083 --> 00:19:30.208
What's a staircase doing here? [gasps]

321
00:19:31.583 --> 00:19:33.667
What is that?

322
00:19:35.375 --> 00:19:39.125
[Tafflah] Ah. That's the leader of Baro Do
who went missing.

323
00:19:39.208 --> 00:19:43.208
Reno chose his successor.
and that's when trading began.

324
00:19:43.292 --> 00:19:44.792
What's he doing here?

325
00:19:44.875 --> 00:19:48.708
Well. the good news is
that hidden hold is large.

326
00:19:48.792 --> 00:19:51.583
It's approximately the size
of a Bibin ore hauler.

327
00:19:51.667 --> 00:19:54.542
More than enough room
for the remaining civilians.

328
00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:57.000
[grunts]

329
00:19:57.708 --> 00:20:01.208
It seems there are some things we've yet
to learn about our old master.

330
00:20:01.292 --> 00:20:03.083
For now. let's get to safety.

331
00:20:04.625 --> 00:20:05.625
Let's go.

332
00:20:05.708 --> 00:20:07.292
[engine powering up]

333
00:20:10.708 --> 00:20:13.042
[distant explosions]

334
00:20:14.667 --> 00:20:16.125
[sobbing]

335
00:20:16.208 --> 00:20:17.792
-[ship approaches]
-[Homen gasps]

336
00:20:26.458 --> 00:20:27.792
[engine powering down]

337
00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.292
[citizens murmuring]

338
00:20:30.375 --> 00:20:32.667
My people. we're here to evacuate you.

339
00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.875
-[all gasping]
-[Tafflah] Begin boarding immediately.

340
00:20:34.958 --> 00:20:36.292
Help each other.

341
00:20:36.375 --> 00:20:38.333
and we will all make it aboard.

342
00:20:38.958 --> 00:20:40.792
[explosions]

343
00:20:47.833 --> 00:20:48.833
[engine roaring]

344
00:20:51.125 --> 00:20:52.458
[rumbling]

345
00:20:53.583 --> 00:20:55.417
[all grunting]

346
00:20:57.208 --> 00:20:58.917
[whooshing]

347
00:21:25.708 --> 00:21:28.042
[Juro] Master Reno
was replacing trade officials

348
00:21:28.125 --> 00:21:31.833
in order to reap the profits from ore
being sold through illegal channels.

349
00:21:32.625 --> 00:21:34.625
There is no justice in this.

350
00:21:34.708 --> 00:21:38.250
We must now consider that our old master
succumbed to the dark side.

351
00:21:38.333 --> 00:21:39.708
[sighs]

352
00:21:39.792 --> 00:21:43.667
-[Kwana] Hmm.
-[gasps]

353
00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.042
My father had a reason
to confront him then?

354
00:21:46.125 --> 00:21:47.125
Yes.

355
00:21:47.708 --> 00:21:48.875
[electronic beeping]

356
00:21:51.208 --> 00:21:52.875
[Juro] Zhima was the one among us

357
00:21:52.958 --> 00:21:55.667
-who was closest to Master Reno.
-[inaudible conversation]

358
00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.875
Perhaps he was trying
to right our master's wrongs.

359
00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:05.500
Yeah. good point. I'm sure that's it!
Uh...

360
00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:08.292
[Kara sighs]

361
00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:10.667
This is my fault.

362
00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:14.083
It's all because I turned my back
and ignored the truth for so long

363
00:22:14.167 --> 00:22:15.500
that this happened.

364
00:22:18.292 --> 00:22:19.917
[stutters] Huh?

365
00:22:23.958 --> 00:22:26.083
[grunts] Dank farrik.

366
00:22:26.167 --> 00:22:28.667
We'll just have to ask Zhima himself.

367
00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:30.042
[Kara and Homen] Hmm.

368
00:22:30.125 --> 00:22:31.542
-[digital beeping]
-[Kara] Huh?

369
00:22:33.583 --> 00:22:35.375
<i>Glad to see you're all right.</i>

370
00:22:35.458 --> 00:22:36.458
<i>What's the status?</i>

371
00:22:36.542 --> 00:22:38.417
[quietly] The main cannon malfunctioned.

372
00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:41.542
-It seems to work like a giant lightsaber.
-[electricity crackling]

373
00:22:41.625 --> 00:22:44.792
And I'm guessing that's the reason
why Nawaam needs Zhima.

374
00:22:45.958 --> 00:22:47.000
Get this.

375
00:22:47.083 --> 00:22:48.792
Nawaam can use the Force.

376
00:22:48.875 --> 00:22:51.583
And for some reason.
he keeps calling Zhima "Master."

377
00:22:51.667 --> 00:22:53.458
-[crackling]
-Uh... [gasps]

378
00:22:55.500 --> 00:22:57.292
-[Four-Nines speaking Binary]
-[Ethan grunts]

379
00:22:59.958 --> 00:23:01.833
-[footsteps departing]
-[both exhale]

380
00:23:01.917 --> 00:23:03.417
-[grunts]
-[beeping]

381
00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:06.083
-[gasps. groans]
-[Four-Nines speaking Binary]

382
00:23:06.708 --> 00:23:09.125
[in English] I don't think my father's
ever had an apprentice.

383
00:23:09.208 --> 00:23:13.542
Unless maybe it was an apprentice that
he had during the time he spent with you?

384
00:23:14.750 --> 00:23:15.750
Can't be.

385
00:23:15.833 --> 00:23:18.417
I would have known
if he had an apprentice.

386
00:23:20.167 --> 00:23:21.667
[low whirring]

387
00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:25.625
[Gennoh] Your thoughts?

388
00:23:25.708 --> 00:23:29.583
[Zhima] Even a single large kyber crystal
would be difficult for this to handle.

389
00:23:29.667 --> 00:23:33.542
And if we repaired it. it's likely
that we would end up with the same result.

390
00:23:34.292 --> 00:23:35.833
[Gennoh] Disappointing.

391
00:23:35.917 --> 00:23:39.500
General Nawaam. why don't we head
to Bibin and settle this?

392
00:23:39.583 --> 00:23:42.000
[Nawaam] If we cannot use the cannon.
then we must wait.

393
00:23:42.083 --> 00:23:45.708
Though of course.
there are other ways of fighting them.

394
00:23:45.792 --> 00:23:47.917
[♪ thrilling music playing]

395
00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.500
This is our plan of attack.

396
00:23:49.583 --> 00:23:50.625
{\an8}[beeps]

397
00:23:50.708 --> 00:23:55.000
{\an8}Our asteroid ships will jump into position
around Yaago.

398
00:23:55.083 --> 00:23:59.208
{\an8}[Homen] Then we will form an orbit
that mirrors an actual asteroid belt

399
00:23:59.292 --> 00:24:01.333
and infiltrate Yaago's airspace.

400
00:24:01.417 --> 00:24:03.875
[Kwana] Then we'll set the ships
on a collision course

401
00:24:03.958 --> 00:24:07.958
with the enemy's so-called secret weapon
and slam right into it.

402
00:24:08.042 --> 00:24:10.125
After we've infiltrated their flagship.

403
00:24:10.208 --> 00:24:13.208
we'll need to evacuate
using their own small ships on board.

404
00:24:13.292 --> 00:24:16.542
Ethan will make contact with my father
and bring him safely to us.

405
00:24:16.625 --> 00:24:18.625
[Juro] Their weapon is reported
to be massive

406
00:24:18.708 --> 00:24:21.000
and will likely have
heavy armor surrounding it.

407
00:24:21.083 --> 00:24:22.458
But no matter how strong.

408
00:24:22.542 --> 00:24:25.458
it won't stand a chance
against orbital asteroid strikes.

409
00:24:25.542 --> 00:24:28.417
Our advantage is not in numbers
but in surprise.

410
00:24:28.500 --> 00:24:31.875
We must strike the enemy
before they can repair the cannon.

411
00:24:31.958 --> 00:24:33.375
[Kara. Kwana and Homen] Hmm.

412
00:24:34.833 --> 00:24:36.542
[engine revving]

413
00:24:45.750 --> 00:24:48.000
<i>Thank you for all you have done for us.</i>

414
00:24:48.083 --> 00:24:51.250
<i>We will now depart to find</i>
<i>a new place to call home.</i>

415
00:24:51.833 --> 00:24:54.000
<i>-Kara...</i>
-[grunts]

416
00:24:54.083 --> 00:24:56.667
[Tafflah] <i>I owe you my life</i>
<i>and my people should know that.</i>

417
00:24:57.542 --> 00:24:59.083
<i>Thank you again.</i>

418
00:24:59.167 --> 00:25:01.792
<i>-But also. I apologize.</i>
-[Kara] Apologize?

419
00:25:01.875 --> 00:25:04.167
I'm grateful for our conversation.

420
00:25:04.833 --> 00:25:07.250
And I wish the very best
for you and your people.

421
00:25:10.167 --> 00:25:11.958
May the Force be with you all.

422
00:25:12.042 --> 00:25:14.250
-[citizens murmuring]
-[Kara gasps] Hmm.

423
00:25:17.458 --> 00:25:19.083
[indistinct chatter]

424
00:25:19.167 --> 00:25:20.167
Finally...

425
00:25:23.042 --> 00:25:24.208
We're going to Yaago.

426
00:25:30.667 --> 00:25:33.000
[♪ valiant music playing]

427
00:25:36.458 --> 00:25:38.125
Now we depart for Yaago!

428
00:25:38.208 --> 00:25:40.792
[all cheering]

429
00:25:49.375 --> 00:25:50.458
Hmm.

430
00:25:52.042 --> 00:25:54.042
[♪ theme music playing]

431
00:26:42.083 --> 00:26:43.250
[♪ music ends]

432
00:26:44.305 --> 00:27:44.192
